      "baseRefName": "main",
      "body": "## Scope\nDocumentation-only feasibility gate for an isolated read-only GeoImpact Review Studio. V5 authoritative outputs, Madrid positive case, Sierra de Baza negative control, CRS/data-rights risks, read-only architecture, acceptance criteria and GO/HOLD gates.\n\n**No change to engine, CLI, dependencies, fixtures, report contract, tests or released versions.** No frontend implemented. No merge or deployment requested.\n\n### Verdict\n- **CONDITIONAL GO:** F1 pinned artifact reproduction then F2 isolated read-only viewer adapter.\n- **HOLD:** publicly published demo, INE redistribution, unvalidated external-user or accessibility claims.\n\nNote: assessment is source/document review only, not an independent runtime reproduction; see limitations in the spec.\n\nFor independent review; leave this PR **Draft**.",
